  "description": "Retitle the document to \"Status Memo\", replace the first paragraph with \"The launch checklist is nearly complete.\", and add heading \"Next Steps\".",
  "instruction": "Retitle the document to \"Status Memo\", replace the first paragraph with \"The launch checklist is nearly complete.\", and add heading \"Next Steps\".",
